check.py          环境校验：对照官方模拟器规格，检查屏幕分辨率/dpi/系统版本\n    ├── driver.py             HarnessTestCase：带超时重试的查找/等待/断言辅助方法\n    ├── window.py             按窗口名从 hidumper 读取 [x y w h]（悬浮窗等不在 UI 树里的窗口）\n    ├── app.py                应用生命周期与导航：restart_app、click_text_path\n    ├── runner.py             测试运行器：发现并执行某道题工程下的测试文件，汇总报告\n    └── report.py             统一的结果报告：pass / fail / error / skip 分开统计，skip 不算通过\n```\n\n## 使用方式\n\n以下命令中 `COMMON` 指工作区的 `common/` 绝对路径，在题目工程目录里可用 `COMMON=\"$(cd ../common && pwd)\"` 得到。\n需要 `hdc` 在 PATH 中（DevEco 的 `sdk/default/openharmony/toolchains`）。\n\n### 1. 环境（每台机器建一次）\n\n`$COMMON/.venv` 不进仓库，按 `requirements.txt` 在本机创建：\n\n```bash\npython3 -m venv \"$COMMON/.venv\"\n\"$COMMON/.venv/bin/python\" -m pip install -r \"$COMMON/test-harness/requirements.txt\" \\\n    --index-url https://repo.huaweicloud.com/repository/pypi/simple\n```\n\n### 2. 校验模拟器是否匹配官方规格\n\n```bash\nPYTHONPATH=\"$COMMON/test-harness\" \"$COMMON/.venv/bin/python\" -m harness.env_check\n```\n\n不一致会给出告警，但不阻塞自测。\n\n### 3. 跑某道题的测试\n\n**先安装本题刚构建的 HAP。** 同一上游项目的多道题共用同一个 bundleName，\n模拟器上装的可能是别的题的产物，直接跑会测错对象。\n\n```bash\ncd <本题工程目录>/logs        # Hypium 会在当前目录生成 reports/，在 logs/ 下运行避免污染工程根目录\nPYTHONPATH=\"$COMMON/test-harness\" \"$COMMON/.venv/bin/python\" -m harness.runner \\\n    --project \"$(cd .. && pwd)\" --device <设备序列号> --json \"$PWD/selftest.json\"\n```\n\n`runner` 会：\n1. 调用 `env_check` 做一次环境校验并记录在报告头部（不阻塞；`--skip-env-check` 可跳过）\n2. 自动发现 `<project>/hypium_tests/test_*.py` 下的所有测试\n3. 执行并输出统一格式的通过/失败报告（终端 + 可选 JSON 文件）\n\n### 4. 给本题写测试点\n\n1. 在本题工程下建 `hypium_tests/__init__.py` 与 `hypium_tests/test_<场景>.py`\n2. 测试类继承 `harness.driver.HarnessTestCase`，可直接使用：\n   `self.driver`、`self.find_or_none()`、`self.require_component()`、`self.require_text()`、\n   `self.require_type()`、`self.require_precondition()`（前置不满足记为 skip，不算通过）\n3. 只写本题 Spec 描述的断言逻辑，不用关心设备连接、重试、报告格式\n\n建议在被测组件上设置稳定的 `.id()`，测试里用 `BY.key(\"<id>\")` 定位，比按文本或类型+顺序定位更稳。\nREADME.md\nharness\nrequirements.txt\n\ncommon/test-harness/harness:\n__init__.py\n__pycache__\napp.py\ndevice.py\ndriver.py\nenv_check.py\nreport.py\nrunner.py\nwindow.py\n\ncommon/test-harness/harness/__pycache__:\n__init__.cpython-313.pyc\napp.cpython-313.pyc\ndevice.cpython-313.pyc\ndriver.cpython-313.pyc\nenv_check.cpython-313.pyc\nreport.cpython-313.pyc\nrunner.cpython-313.pyc\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01VFib2MuWXyyTRbKJYvRZFL","type":"TOOL","toolName":"read_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cm-spec26/spec/1-do.md"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:27f93030c8ccfe919d8a85115a509aa0f8d5029500c05287081d7cf64c0fbba4","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":8992,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"relativePath":"spec/1-do.md","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cm-spec26/spec/1-do.md","resolution":"absolute","endLine":135,"startLine":1,"totalLines":135}}}]},{"id":"6ad61662e2713b7e00fe7dcf","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":8681},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"95730c9c-6a01-41ca-9326-a2fa86b4c5ac","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Now I need to set up the baseline tag. There's already a tag base/cm-spec26 pointing to b2f0caa, but I'm considering whether to create baseline-cm-spec26 at the current HEAD (156af4d) instead, since it includes the ohpm lock prep changes, and I want to document the distinction between the two reference points.\n\nNext, I should verify the build environment is ready -- checking whether hvigorw, hdc, and an emulator are available.\n\n","startTime":1792415335613,"lastModifiedTime":1792415338677},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_015ezs1Zjey7pEYrtBUMks6n","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"which hvigorw hdc ohpm node java 2>&1; ls /Applications | grep -i deveco; echo $DEVECO_SDK_HOME; ls ~/Library/Huawei 2>/dev/null | head","description":"Check build toolchain availability","prefix_rule":"[\"which\"]"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Comm